Z||000008||Oreif||03-29-2000||02:43 AM||||Mona,<BR>Here's the directions<BR>Terre Haute, IN to 600 north road<BR>Paxton, IL<BR> 116.4 miles 162 mins <P><BR> Directions miles <BR>1. Start out going North on US-40 W/US-150 N/US-41 N towards US-41 N/IN-63 N by turning left. 0.1 <BR>2. Stay straight to go onto US-41 N/IN-63 N. 1.8 <BR>3. Turn SLIGHT LEFT onto IN-63 N. 45.5 <BR>4. Turn LEFT. 0.0 <BR>5. Turn SLIGHT LEFT to take the I-74 WEST ramp. 0.3 <BR>6. Merge onto I-74 W. 44.7 <BR>7. Take the I-57 NORTH exit 0.4 <BR>8. Merge onto I-57 N. 23.3 <BR>9. Take the IL-9 exit 0.3 <BR>10. Keep RIGHT at the fork in the ramp. 0.0 <BR>11. Merge onto IL-9 E. 0.1 <P>||||reg||2
