Z||000011||LilFieroGT||03-30-2000||12:39 AM||||Hey mona.. i got your directions for you... once you get into Paxton,off of I-57 follow the signs for route 9.  you will take a few left and right turns.  then u will cross a small bridge that goes over the train tracks.  Then u will hit a stop sign. take a left and follow that road all the way out of town. You will see the place on the right a couple miles down the road. you can't miss it<BR>Matt||||reg||1
Z||000012||Oreif||03-30-2000||03:26 AM||||Mona, IL-9 is North Road the address is 100. The address was listed at the top. When you start down the road it will be on the right hand side Just look for Bob's Fiero's That he has for sale, They face the road.||||reg||1
