Z||000014||Old Lar||03-31-2000||08:24 PM||||I had planned on going, but it is a 750 mile drive one way.  You can all check on the progress of my 88 white GT which is getting Bob's touch.  A 3.4 L mated to a T440 automatic, plus brakes and what ever else needs to be done.  He's replacing the 3.1 L engine with only 15K miles on it.  Make Bob an offer on that low milage unit.  He converted the AC last year to the 134 refrigerant, replaced the compressor, and replaced some other stuff.  Good Fiero man.<P>This car has parts purchased from many of the vendors from this site.  Rodney  Dickman, Tim Perrigo (FOCONE), The Fiero Store, FOCOA, Associated Auto Inc, Kick Hill Farms, the Wisconsin Fiero Fanatic John P and even Mr. Goodwrench. One way or another this car will run like a top.||||reg||1
